      "worked": "$$\\begin{align*}m_T&=\\tan150^\\circ=-\\frac1{\\sqrt3}\\\\y'&=-\\frac2{\\sqrt{4x+10}}\\\\-\\frac2{\\sqrt{4x+10}}&=-\\frac1{\\sqrt3}\\\\\\sqrt{4x+10}&=2\\sqrt3\\\\4x+10&=12\\\\x&=\\frac12\\\\y\\!\\left(\\frac12\\right)&=-\\sqrt{12}=-2\\sqrt3\\end{align*}$$\nUsing point–gradient form at $\\left(\\frac12,-2\\sqrt3\\right)$,\n$$\\begin{align*}y+2\\sqrt3&=-\\frac1{\\sqrt3}\\left(x-\\frac12\\right)\\\\y&=-\\frac{x}{\\sqrt3}-\\frac{11}{2\\sqrt3}.\\end{align*}$$",
